<div class="error-page card">
  <div class="error-code">404</div>
  <h1>页面走丢了</h1>
  <p>你访问的页面不存在，或者已经被移动。</p>
  <div class="error-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="<%- url_for('/') %>">返回首页</a>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" onclick="history.back()">返回上一页</button>
  </div>
</div>
